  "details": "ネームプレート周りが見づらすぎるのと、特にユーザーランクの表示が直感的ではなさすぎるので、初心者案内でも、え、どこですか？と聞かれる事が増えた\n\nこれに関しては、本当デザインを追加で、選択式にして欲しいです。\n\nThe area around the nameplate is extremely hard to read, and the user rank display, in particular, is far from intuitive; this has led to an increase in beginners asking, \"Wait, where is it?\" during tutorials.\n\nHonestly, I really wish they would add more design options and let us choose which one to use.",
